\item OpenAI, \emph{A power saving for planar halving lines}, 2026-09-25; citation key \texttt{OAI:A-power-saving-for-planar-halving-lines-September-25-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-halving-lines-September-25-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-halving-lines-September-25-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-halving-lines-September-25-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-halving-lines-September-25-2026/main.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-halving-lines-September-25-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex\#L9}{thm:halving-power}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-halving-lines-September-25-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex\#L76}{thm:all-ranks}.
\item Family 183: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/183.md}{Lean scope}.
